WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Not one day, but every day. Ten minutes today, twenty tomorrow.. Band 7 is not a

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
talent, it is a habit.. Do not wait to be perfect; be consistent.. Making

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
mistakes is proof that you are learning.. Small steps create a big band

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
difference.. What feels hard today becomes automatic tomorrow.. You are not

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
studying English, you are living it.. Not motivation, a schedule wins.. Every

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
wrong answer is a clue to the right strategy.. The exam measures your

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
preparation, not your worth..
